# A declaration word (notes/layers.md, sugar; an early sugar module, rewriting the program before the passes): `var x = 1`,
# and `let`, `const` and the other constant words (Rust twin: words.rs CONSTANT_KEYWORDS), are the assignment `x = 1`;
# that a constant binds once is the checks' to say
rewrite (var $d) => $d
rewrite (let $d) => $d
rewrite (const $d) => $d
rewrite (constant $d) => $d
rewrite (final $d) => $d
rewrite (val $d) => $d
